{
  "slug": "claude-md-optimizer",
  "name": "Claude Md Optimizer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Optimize oversized CLAUDE.md files using progressive disclosure, content tiers, encryption constraints, and sub-documents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `claude-md-optimizer`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-md-optimizer@claude-community` from `wrsmith108/claude-md-optimizer`.\n\nA Claude Code skill that optimizes oversized agent instruction files using progressive disclosure. Handles CLAUDE.md (Claude Code), AGENTS.md (OpenAI Codex / GitHub Copilot agents), and copilot-instructions.md (GitHub Copilot). Auto-detects all three formats, analyzes content tiers, creates sub-documents using each format's native mechanism, and rewrites the main file — with zero information loss.",
